WEBVTT

00:00:12.740 --> 00:00:15.700
One hundred years have passed
since the Battle of Galluah Plains,

00:00:15.700 --> 00:00:18.740
where King Kyle defeated
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:21.870
The Demons rise again,
threatening the world,

00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:25.080
spreading fear and unrest to all.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:29.080
Kasel finds Clause at the Tower of the Sage,

00:00:29.080 --> 00:00:32.290
where the Great Sage Dominix explains to Kasel

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:35.790
that Kasel is the son of King Kyle.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:40.990
I will explain everything.

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:46.450
The things that happened
when King Kyle was alive...

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:21.910
<i></i>What the

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:21.910
<i></i>Predecessors

00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:21.910
<i></i>Left Behind

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:35.830
I got us some food.

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:37.950
Good work, Tamm.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:39.490
Was there any trouble?

00:02:39.490 --> 00:02:43.910
Not really. The shopkeeper looked
really uncomfortable when he saw me,

00:02:43.910 --> 00:02:47.700
but the moment I mentioned Lord Moriham,
his attitude completely flipped.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:48.910
I see...

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:51.830
This is for you, Azal and Zucca.

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:52.910
Thanks.

00:02:52.910 --> 00:02:54.410
Riheet, I'll put yours over here.

00:02:54.410 --> 00:02:55.410
Yeah...

00:02:55.410 --> 00:02:57.290
Ripine.

00:02:57.290 --> 00:03:00.120
Ripine, you wanted to eat it
freshly baked, right?

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.580
Go ahead, take a bite.

00:03:12.040 --> 00:03:15.160
That bean bread is pretty good, huh?

00:03:17.620 --> 00:03:21.080
Orvelian foods are all too salty.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:23.370
Huh. I guess we don't agree on that one.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.660
One hundred years ago, when King Kyle lived,

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:32.160
dark elves like us were able
to live in this city, too, right?

00:03:32.160 --> 00:03:38.450
Yeah. It's all Illya's fault that
we cause a scene just by walking around.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:41.990
Don't mention that name. You'll set Riheet off.

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:48.790
It's fine. Illya is the reason why dark elves
are persecuted--it's simply the truth.

00:03:48.790 --> 00:03:50.490
True that.

00:03:55.660 --> 00:03:57.740
One hundred years ago...

00:03:57.740 --> 00:04:00.790
This was when King Kyle was just a prince.

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:30.370
Kyle, you've gotten better at this.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:33.620
It's all thanks to your training, Illya.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:40.620
Both of you were quite impressive.
How about some rest?

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:43.160
Dominix, you're here.

00:04:43.160 --> 00:04:44.370
Yes.

00:04:46.410 --> 00:04:50.620
Delicious... This is food sold
in the town, isn't it?

00:04:50.620 --> 00:04:54.330
Yeah. I wanted to try it for lunch.

00:04:54.330 --> 00:04:57.580
Did you sneak out into the town again?

00:04:57.580 --> 00:04:59.040
Yeah, so?

00:04:59.040 --> 00:05:01.040
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:04.830
I know, I know...
Stop worrying.

00:05:01.040 --> 00:05:02.370
Know your place!

00:05:02.370 --> 00:05:04.830
King Kyle was full of curiosity,

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:09.160
and always wanted to know about
the lives of the people.

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:08.580
What if you go into town and
something dangerous happens?

00:05:08.580 --> 00:05:11.040
You are the successor to
the throne, you know.

00:05:09.160 --> 00:05:15.450
His elder half-sister Illya worried about him,
but also loved him very much.

00:05:11.040 --> 00:05:14.160
You know how good I am
with a sword.

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:15.450
Kyle...

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:18.870
I want to see how the citizens
live with my own eyes.

00:05:18.870 --> 00:05:25.870
What do they feel during their lives?
What do they eat? What makes them happy?

00:05:25.870 --> 00:05:28.790
A lot of things you can't see from the castle

00:05:28.790 --> 00:05:31.540
are clear and visible in the streets.

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.740
Without citizens, there is no nation.

00:05:35.740 --> 00:05:40.910
If we royals do nothing
but hoard wealth and wield power,

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:43.990
Orvelia will be in ruins before we know it.

00:05:43.990 --> 00:05:48.080
I want to become a king that can protect
his people and make them happy.

00:05:49.080 --> 00:05:53.740
You will. I'm sure you will
become a splendid king.

00:05:53.740 --> 00:05:55.120
Thanks, Illya.

00:05:55.120 --> 00:05:59.450
One day, when you become king,
I'll make sure to assist you

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.200
with my knowledge of technomagic.

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:02.950
That's reassuring.

00:06:07.660 --> 00:06:09.830
Hey, Dominix...

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:13.660
For the past few years, Orvelia has seen
nothing but peace and prosperity.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:16.830
Why do some of
our people suffer in poverty?

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:20.120
That is because the war with
the neighboring nations lasted so long.

00:06:20.120 --> 00:06:26.370
War costs money, and families who have
lost working-age members tend to go poor.

00:06:27.330 --> 00:06:31.040
Who was that war for? It's all meaningless.

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:35.700
To become a king that protects its people
and makes them happy...

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:42.540
To live up to this conviction,
King Kyle studied and trained well.

00:06:46.370 --> 00:06:50.540
King Kyle was young,
and full of dreams and hope.

00:06:55.790 --> 00:06:59.990
And the person with whom
he shared his dreams was Arlette.

00:06:59.990 --> 00:07:02.990
Arlette? Could that be...

00:07:02.990 --> 00:07:06.160
Yes. Your mother.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:16.950
How was Kasel's mother alive
one hundred years ago?

00:07:16.950 --> 00:07:19.830
I will explain that later.

00:07:23.160 --> 00:07:27.990
Back then, Kyle and Arlette
were very happy together.

00:07:27.990 --> 00:07:30.830
But that didn't last very long...

00:07:32.490 --> 00:07:35.870
When they found out that Kyle
and Arlette were romantically involved,

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:39.910
the King and the nobles
forced them to separate.

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:44.330
Kyle was the successor to the King.

00:07:44.330 --> 00:07:49.540
Arlette was an obstacle to
their plans for a political marriage.

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:54.490
Kyle's tragedies did not end there.

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:56.490
The Demons appeared.

00:08:01.240 --> 00:08:07.370
The Demons invaded our world,
attacking and destroying towns and villages.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:16.580
King Kyle lead his army and defeated
the Demons time and time again.

00:08:24.290 --> 00:08:28.410
That was when King Median the First,
Kyle's father, passed away suddenly.

00:08:28.410 --> 00:08:30.990
Kyle ascended to the throne.

00:08:46.490 --> 00:08:50.990
The Demonic invasion continues,
our situation is still dire!

00:08:50.990 --> 00:08:57.290
But now that I am king, I vow to defeat
every single one of these Demons!

00:08:57.290 --> 00:09:00.410
As the king, I will protect my people!

00:09:04.910 --> 00:09:07.410
Time to fulfill my promise...

00:09:08.410 --> 00:09:14.790
The newly crowned King Kyle raised
the Orvelian army's morale.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:20.410
King Kyle met with Lorraine of
the Elves and Aeatola of the Orcs

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:22.790
and entered into an alliance.

00:09:22.790 --> 00:09:27.160
He wanted to defeat the Demons
as a combined force.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:32.200
Everyone accepted and trusted King Kyle
due to his wisdom and his courage.

00:09:32.200 --> 00:09:36.040
But the Demons had
a massive advantage in numbers.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:38.330
King Kyle was injured during battle,

00:09:38.330 --> 00:09:42.240
and found Arlette at a shelter.

00:09:42.240 --> 00:09:44.540
At that point, inside of Arlette...

00:09:45.580 --> 00:09:49.120
...was you, Kasel.

00:09:52.740 --> 00:09:57.830
Kyle was extremely pleased to know
that Arlette was with child.

00:10:00.080 --> 00:10:05.040
It must be a boy! Let's name him Kasel!

00:10:05.040 --> 00:10:09.910
I want to protect this world,
for the child who will soon arrive.

00:10:16.490 --> 00:10:22.330
As if responding to his wish, Lua,
the Goddess of Light, appeared.

00:10:27.080 --> 00:10:31.910
Lua gave King Kyle the Holy Sword Aea...

00:10:33.660 --> 00:10:37.950
...to save the world from
the Dark Lord, Angmund.

00:10:48.450 --> 00:10:51.450
I have received a divine message
from Lua, the Goddess of Light.

00:10:51.450 --> 00:10:58.080
When a red ring covers the moon, the Dark Lord
will appear and threaten the world.

00:10:58.080 --> 00:11:02.790
But with the Holy Sword Aea,
the Dark Lord can be destroyed.

00:11:02.790 --> 00:11:06.410
Everyone, please, lend me aid.

00:11:06.410 --> 00:11:10.700
We all swore to fight by King Kyle's side.

00:11:10.700 --> 00:11:16.200
Meanwhile, Illya began to devote herself
to the study of technomagic,

00:11:16.200 --> 00:11:21.870
without even thinking about
what it could lead to...

00:11:27.490 --> 00:11:28.830
Illya...

00:11:28.830 --> 00:11:33.450
Her study of technomagic led to her
being put on trial after her death,

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:35.620
and she was found guilty, right?

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.790
Yes, I think I've heard that story, too.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:40.870
She tried to build another Holy Sword.

00:11:40.870 --> 00:11:44.490
Yes. She attempted to create a false Holy Sword.

00:11:44.490 --> 00:11:55.120
The people of Orvelia believed this was
a blasphemous challenge against Lua.

00:11:55.120 --> 00:11:57.660
Why did she want to make a false Holy Sword...?

00:11:59.450 --> 00:12:02.740
Illya was trying to fulfill her promise.

00:12:06.200 --> 00:12:11.240
She wanted to help King Kyle
with her own studies.

00:12:11.240 --> 00:12:14.450
Finally, the day arrived.

00:12:16.370 --> 00:12:21.580
Do you know the red star,
shining brighter than any other star in the sky?

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:22.580
Yes.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:28.240
When that "Nocturnal Sun" intersects the moon,
the moon gets a red glowing ring.

00:12:28.240 --> 00:12:31.620
That day, 100 years ago,
a sorcerer serving the Republic of Gray

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:37.790
named Malduk used a forbidden magic
to tear open a dimensional fissure,

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:40.410
through which he brought in
the Dark Lord Angmund.

00:12:44.990 --> 00:12:47.740
King Kyle took the Holy Sword Aea,

00:12:47.740 --> 00:12:51.410
and along with his friends,
set out to defeat the Dark Lord.

00:12:52.990 --> 00:12:57.990
At the same time,
Illya's research was completed.

00:12:57.990 --> 00:13:04.330
She chased after King Kyle,
but was killed by Demons on the way.

00:13:04.330 --> 00:13:08.330
She was not able to meet King Kyle.

00:13:08.330 --> 00:13:14.950
King Kyle, with the help from his companions,
faced off against Angmund.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:16.700
However...

00:13:16.700 --> 00:13:22.540
After the battle, both King Kyle
and Angmund disappeared.

00:13:22.540 --> 00:13:27.040
The only thing that was left
was the Holy Sword Aea.

00:13:27.040 --> 00:13:31.200
After that, Demonic activities
began to die down,

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.950
and peace returned to the world.

00:13:33.950 --> 00:13:40.370
But Malduk escaped,
and nobody knows where King Kyle went.

00:13:43.790 --> 00:13:48.540
That is the story of your father, King Kyle.

00:13:48.540 --> 00:13:51.990
King Kyle was a brave king.

00:13:51.990 --> 00:13:57.370
He risked his life to fight the
Dark Lord, to protect everyone.

00:13:57.370 --> 00:14:03.580
Yes. If it wasn't for King Kyle,
the world would have been destroyed.

00:14:03.580 --> 00:14:08.160
After the battle, King Kyle's companions
sealed away the Holy Sword Aea,

00:14:08.160 --> 00:14:12.040
and decided to each hold
the key to break that seal,

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:16.450
to ensure that the seal remains unbroken
until the day the Dark Lord returns,

00:14:16.450 --> 00:14:18.990
and humanity requires
the Holy Sword's power again.

00:14:18.990 --> 00:14:22.660
At the same time, Illya was
put on trial after her death,

00:14:22.660 --> 00:14:28.080
for the crime of defiling Lua by
trying to create a false Holy Sword.

00:14:28.080 --> 00:14:30.160
The result was a guilty verdict.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:34.330
From then on, all dark elves in Orvelia,
including Illya's own family,

00:14:34.330 --> 00:14:36.040
were persecuted.

00:14:40.490 --> 00:14:42.370
Hey, Riheet.

00:14:42.370 --> 00:14:44.740
That story about Illya earlier...

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:50.240
Didn't she think for a moment that
her actions could affect all dark elves?

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:52.660
Why do you ask?

00:14:52.660 --> 00:14:57.660
I was thinking, if I could go back in time
just once, what would I do?

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:02.080
That's impossible and absurd.

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:04.950
I'm just saying, what if!

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:11.040
I want to go back and save my parents
and brothers from getting killed,

00:15:11.040 --> 00:15:15.950
but I also want to go back 100 years
and give Illya a good punch in the face!

00:15:15.950 --> 00:15:18.330
To that, I agree.

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:26.990
There's no way to go back in time.
Illya means nothing.

00:15:26.990 --> 00:15:33.290
What's important is, after Illya's death,
dark elves are persecuted in Orvelia

00:15:33.290 --> 00:15:36.160
and much blood was spilled.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:38.870
Our grievances against Orvelia will be settled.

00:15:48.080 --> 00:15:51.990
Mr. Dominix, please tell me about my mother.

00:15:51.990 --> 00:15:55.740
What did she do for 100 years
after those events?

00:15:55.740 --> 00:15:58.830
King Kyle left behind the Holy Sword Aea,

00:15:58.830 --> 00:16:01.700
but there was no one who could use it properly.

00:16:01.700 --> 00:16:08.660
We believed that only those who carried
King Kyle's blood could inherit the sword.

00:16:08.660 --> 00:16:12.830
We feared that, if Malduk was still alive,

00:16:12.830 --> 00:16:16.790
he would attempt to bring Angmund back
when the "Nocturnal Sun" intersects

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.620
the moon again 100 years later.

00:16:19.620 --> 00:16:24.290
If that happens, we will need
the Holy Sword and its heir.

00:16:24.290 --> 00:16:28.790
We decided to put Arlette to sleep.

00:16:28.790 --> 00:16:31.490
That's...

00:16:31.490 --> 00:16:37.990
After almost 100 years, Arlette woke up
and gave birth to you.

00:16:37.990 --> 00:16:44.200
But Demons attacked your village,
and Arlette was killed.

00:16:44.200 --> 00:16:51.200
With no parents and no place to live,
it was me who sent you to that orphanage.

00:16:51.950 --> 00:16:58.160
So it wasn't a coincidence
that you visited us at our orphanage.

00:16:58.160 --> 00:17:03.240
Correct. I have been watching over
your growth this whole time.

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:07.160
I have no doubt that you are King Kyle's son.

00:17:10.990 --> 00:17:16.040
The "Nocturnal Sun" is on the verge
of intersecting with the moon.

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:20.290
So the Dark Lord is coming back?
I thought King Kyle defeated him.

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:24.370
Nobody knows just how much damage
the Dark Lord sustained in battle.

00:17:24.370 --> 00:17:28.200
I believe that the recent increase
in Demonic activity is a harbinger

00:17:28.200 --> 00:17:32.410
to the return of the Dark Lord.

00:17:36.950 --> 00:17:40.910
Honestly, just being told that
I'm the son of King Kyle

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:44.200
isn't enough to convince me that it's true.

00:17:51.160 --> 00:17:52.200
But...

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:56.040
But I want power! If I had power...

00:17:56.040 --> 00:18:02.240
If I had the Holy Sword,
I could protect everyone.

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.870
Please tell me, Mr. Dominix!

00:18:04.870 --> 00:18:08.370
How can I get the Holy Sword?

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:12.910
In order to acquire the Holy Sword,
you must first break its seal.

00:18:12.910 --> 00:18:17.370
First, go meet Lorraine,
the Grand Sage of the Forest of Elidora.

00:18:17.370 --> 00:18:21.870
Lorraine... One of King Kyle's
companions in the battle, right?

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:25.490
Yes. I would go with you,

00:18:25.490 --> 00:18:29.240
but I cannot leave the Tower of the Sage.

00:18:29.240 --> 00:18:32.040
Cleo, Roi, please enter.

00:18:32.040 --> 00:18:33.290
Whoa!

00:18:34.790 --> 00:18:36.700
Why close the door...?

00:18:36.700 --> 00:18:38.330
Oh.

00:18:38.330 --> 00:18:45.080
I-I wasn't eavesdropping!
I just happened to pass by.

00:18:45.080 --> 00:18:50.410
I honestly wasn't listening! I heard nothing
about the Holy Sword or King Kyle!

00:18:50.410 --> 00:18:54.290
I'm sorry. I did listen for a bit.

00:18:54.290 --> 00:18:59.450
There is no need to apologize.
I knew from the start that you were there.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:00.160
Seriously?

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.370
Wow, what a great sage.

00:19:02.370 --> 00:19:04.410
These two will accompany you.

00:19:04.410 --> 00:19:05.410
Huh?

00:19:10.410 --> 00:19:14.160
Cleo is a very talented sorcerer.

00:19:14.160 --> 00:19:17.740
Roi has many useful skills as well.
They should be able to help you.

00:19:17.740 --> 00:19:22.290
Yay! I get to leave this place!

00:19:22.290 --> 00:19:25.830
Can't you at least pretend to be sad?

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:27.990
You really are honest, Cleo.

00:19:27.990 --> 00:19:31.120
She always talks about
how she wants to go outside.

00:19:36.700 --> 00:19:39.790
Now that I'm coming along, you can feel safe!

00:19:39.790 --> 00:19:42.330
I'll protect you from any danger!

00:19:42.330 --> 00:19:43.580
Yes...

00:19:43.580 --> 00:19:45.830
And I'm her babysitter...

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:48.620
You're my bodyguard! Bodyguard!

00:19:48.620 --> 00:19:54.620
Cleo, Roi, please support them on
their journey to unseal the Holy Sword.

00:19:54.620 --> 00:19:55.740
Yes.

00:19:55.740 --> 00:19:56.760
Frey.

00:19:56.760 --> 00:19:57.580
Yes.

00:19:57.580 --> 00:20:00.540
Please take care of Kasel.

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:01.990
I understand.

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:04.370
Now go, Kasel.

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:06.870
The only way to protect this world

00:20:06.870 --> 00:20:10.450
is by finding the Holy Sword Aea as its heir.

00:20:10.450 --> 00:20:11.740
Yes.

00:20:14.080 --> 00:20:16.740
You're King Kyle's...?!

00:20:16.740 --> 00:20:21.410
I still can't believe I'm the son of King Kyle.

00:20:21.410 --> 00:20:25.200
That's why I have to find out
for myself if it's true.

00:20:25.200 --> 00:20:29.290
If it is true... I want to find
the Holy Sword Aea.

00:20:29.290 --> 00:20:33.870
With the Holy Sword,
I'm sure I can protect everyone!

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:37.410
Do you realize how dangerous
this is going to be?

00:20:37.410 --> 00:20:41.580
Yeah. But I still want to get the Holy Sword!

00:20:41.580 --> 00:20:45.370
I don't want to see anyone else
suffer because of the Demons.

00:20:54.660 --> 00:20:57.660
I understand. Go.

00:20:57.660 --> 00:21:02.700
Don't worry about Orvelia.
I'll make sure to defend your home.

00:21:02.700 --> 00:21:04.830
Clause...

00:21:04.830 --> 00:21:08.660
Kasel, Frey. You have to
come back in one piece.

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:09.400
Yeah!

00:21:09.400 --> 00:21:11.200
Of course, Clause.

00:21:18.950 --> 00:21:24.370
There are so many places I want to visit!
And so many things I want to eat!

00:21:24.370 --> 00:21:26.990
This isn't a sightseeing trip, you know.

00:21:26.990 --> 00:21:29.450
I know!

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.200
Anyway, nice to work with both of you!

00:21:32.200 --> 00:21:33.240
Yes!

00:21:40.740 --> 00:21:42.870
Let's go.

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:45.200
Ready? Off we go!

00:23:47.040 --> 00:23:49.370
Our fate is set in motion.

00:23:49.370 --> 00:23:54.700
We arrived at the Forest of Elidora
in search of the Holy Sword Aea.

00:23:54.700 --> 00:23:58.950
However, the mysterious forest
itself seems to reject us,

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.880
<i></i>The Forest and

00:23:58.370 --> 00:24:00.880
<i></i>the Elves

00:23:58.950 --> 00:24:00.240
stubbornly refusing to let us in.
